  "description": "20\" Dirt Jump/Pumptrack bike for kids 5-8 with 80mm air fork.\nA lightweight but burly 6061 T6 alloy frame with a hydroformed downtube, ISCG-05 chainguard tabs and sliding, bolt-on rear dropouts with our unique taper lock design.\nWe round this bike out with the best component spec in the market with our exclusive offering of parts from Brood Bike Co. Brood Eldorado fork with carbon fiber lowers and 80mm of nearly stiction-free travel, 140mm 2-piece, thru-axle Brood Styx cranks, Brood's direct mount chainwheel, the Throne Pivotal seat, A Bar Named Sue handlebars and Tenderriderz grips, and a Tektro Auriga rear disc brake.\nA legit, but versatile dirt jumper for groms that comes in at 22 lbs. Some minor assembly will be necessary.\nWhat can you do with a Kotori? Check it out here!",
